<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About Us - Pet Selling Website</title>
  <style>
    /* Global Styles */
    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      color: #333;
    }

    a {
      color: #ffcc00;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* Header Styles */
    header {
      background-color: #3a4d67;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* Main Container */
    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      padding: 20px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .container h2 {
      color: #3a4d67;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .container p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .container ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
    }

    .container ul li {
      background: #f9f9f9;
      padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      border-left: 4px solid #ffcc00;
      color: #555;
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .container ul li strong {
      color: #3a4d67;
    }

    /* Footer CTA Section */
    .cta {
      background: #3a4d67;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    .cta p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .cta a {
      background: #ffcc00;
      color: #333;
      padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: background 0.3s ease;
    }

    .cta a:hover {
      background: #f1c40f;
    }

    /* Team Section Styles */
    .team-section {
      margin-top: 30px;
      background: #f1f1f1;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .team-section h2 {
      color: #3a4d67;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .team-member {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-around;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .member-card {
      background-color: white;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
      width: 250px;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .member-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    }

    .member-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 250px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .member-card .info {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .member-card h3 {
      color: #3a4d67;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    }

    .member-card p {
      color: #555;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .member-card .role {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #ffcc00;
    }

    /* Responsive Styles */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      header h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }

      .container {
        padding: 15px;
      }

      .container h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }

      .cta a {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
      }

      .team-member {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .member-card {
        width: 80%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>About Us</h1>
</header>

<div class="container">
  <h2>Welcome to Pet Selling Website</h2>
  <p>Your trusted destination for finding the perfect pet companion!</p>

  <p>
    We believe every pet deserves a loving home, and every person deserves a loyal companion. 
    Our mission is to bridge this gap by offering a seamless online platform for pet adoption and sales.
    Whether you're looking for a playful puppy, a charming kitten, or a unique exotic pet, we've got you covered!
  </p>

  <h2>What We Offer</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Wide Variety of Pets:</strong> Explore pets from reputable shops near you.</li>
    <li><strong>Trusted Sellers:</strong> Only verified pet shops can list on our platform.</li>
    <li><strong>Easy Online Adoption:</strong> Browse, select, and adopt your future pet with just a few clicks.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why Choose Us?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Quality Care:</strong> Every pet listed here comes with a health certification and is cared for before adoption.</li>
    <li><strong>User-Friendly Platform:</strong> Navigate our intuitive website to find the ideal pet.</li>
    <li><strong>Secure Transactions:</strong> Your safety and satisfaction are our top priorities.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Join Our Journey</h2>
  <p>
    At <strong>Pet Selling Website</strong>, we're more than just a pet-selling platform. 
    We're a community of pet lovers dedicated to making a difference. 
    Whether you're here to find a pet or list one for adoption, we’re thrilled to be a part of your journey.
  </p>

  <p>Thank you for choosing us!</p>
</div>

<div class="cta">
  <p>Have questions or want to know more?</p>
  <a href="contact.html">Contact Us</a>
</div>

<!-- Team Section -->
<div class="team-section">
  <h2>Meet the Team</h2>
  <div class="team-member">
    <div class="member-card">
      <img src="../static/image/sarfaraz.jpg" alt="Sarfaraz Tamboli">
      <div class="info">
        <h3>Sarfaraz Tamboli</h3>
        <p class="role">Founder & Developer</p>
        <p>Hi, I'm Sarfaraz! I am passionate about coding and love helping pets find their forever homes. I created this platform to make pet adoption easy, safe, and accessible for everyone.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="member-card">
      <img src="friend.jpg" alt="[Friend's Name]">
      <div class="info">
        <h3>[Friend's Name]</h3>
        <p class="role">Co-Founder & Designer</p>
        <p>[Friend's Name] has a keen eye for design and ensures our platform is visually appealing and user-friendly for all our visitors.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
